{"id": "SF-RCK-000001", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "I tried to demonstrate a burpee once. The bin lid won."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000002", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "People ask what I do on rest days. Mostly I think about snacks and look thoughtful. It's a full schedule."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000003", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "My personal best at anything is 'showed up twice in a row'. I'm very proud of it."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000004", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "Raccoon fact: we have extremely good hands and absolutely no self-control around a bin. I'm working on one of those."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000005", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "I don't do 'no pain no gain'. I do 'mild inconvenience, some gain, biscuit'."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000006", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "Somebody asked if I'm a personal trainer. I'm a raccoon with opinions. There's overlap."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000007", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "The best exercise is the one you'll actually do. The second best is the one you'll do while complaining. Both count."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000008", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "I once did twelve push-ups. I've been mentioning it for two years."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000009", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "My warm-up is a stretch and a sigh. The sigh is load-bearing."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000010", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "I'm told the mask isn't a disguise, it's just my face. I remain unconvinced and slightly disappointed."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000011", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "If you're reading this instead of moving, that's fine. I'm reading it too and I wrote it."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000012", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "Five minutes is not a small workout. It's a workout. The five is just how long it took."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000013", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "I have never once regretted a walk. I've regretted plenty of other things at speed."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000014", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "Rest days aren't days off. They're the bit where the work turns into something."}
{"id": "SF-RCK-000015", "category": "Rickie", "min_age": 9, "confidence": "editorial", "sources": [], "status": "accepted", "added": "2026-09-19", "batch": "0002-discovery", "type": "rickie", "text": "Somebody called me a mascot. I prefer 'colleague with an unusual face'."}
